### Ensure line endings are handled correctly across OS platforms

* text=auto

### Treat common web assets as binary data to prevent corruption

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary 

### Exclude package managers and lockfiles from GitHub language statistics

package-lock.json linguist-vendored
yarn.lock linguist-vendored
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-vendored
bun.lockb linguist-vendored 

### Exclude dependency and local build folders from GitHub language statistics

node_modules/ linguist-vendored
.next/ linguist-vendored
.nuxt/ linguist-vendored
.svelte-kit/ linguist-vendored
dist/ linguist-vendored
build/ linguist-vendored
out/ linguist-vendored
coverage/ linguist-vendored 

### Override common extensions that GitHub Linguist frequently misidentifies as 'Hack'

*.hh linguist-language=HTML
*.php linguist-language=PHP
*.html linguist-language=HTML
*.js linguist-language=JavaScript
*.ts linguist-language=TypeScript